{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前，任天堂Switch 2被曝出現一種奇怪的故障，部分主機冷卻後無法開機，加熱後卻能恢復正常啓動。據GAZLOG報道，近期，多名維修人員報告了Switch 2的晶片相關故障，<strong>部分故障原因或在於英偉達SoC晶片與主板之間的焊接不良。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588202.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.158858+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:39:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"efdbd858ff021b601393fc734bc55607bc7dabe5328854be5bee30b463cec4c1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}